+        <li><strong>Data Minimization:</strong> We collect only the minimum data strictly necessary to provide the specific feature you request.</li>
+        <li><strong>Automated Privacy Signals:</strong> We automatically honor <strong>Global Privacy Control (<code>Sec-GPC: 1</code>)</strong> and <strong>Do Not Track (<code>DNT: 1</code>)</strong> signals from your browser.</li>
