+            Hosted on <code>us-central1-web-devrel-apps.cloudfunctions.net</code>. This script is inert by default (rendered as <code>type="text/plain"</code>) and is only loaded if you explicitly enable <em>Analytics Script</em> in your Privacy Preferences. When enabled, it loads with <code>crossorigin="anonymous"</code> and <code>referrerpolicy="no-referrer"</code>, and is strictly excluded from <code>/signin</code> and <code>/signup</code> pages.
+        </li>
+        <li>
+            <strong>Contextual Advertising Slots (<code>window.adNetwork</code> &mdash; Opt-In Only):</strong>
+            Banner and fireplace ad slots (<code>AdSlotBanner</code> and <code>AdSlotFireplace</code>) remain uninitialized and hidden by default unless you explicitly enable <em>Contextual Ad Slots</em> in your Privacy Preferences.
+        </li>
+        <li>
+            <strong>Web Fonts (Google Fonts):</strong>
+            The <em>Grenze</em> display font is loaded from <code>fonts.googleapis.com</code> and <code>fonts.gstatic.com</code> using <code>crossorigin="anonymous"</code> and <code>referrerpolicy="no-referrer"</code> so neither cookies nor full page URLs are transmitted.
+        </li>
+    </ul>
+
+    <h2>5. Document Privacy &amp; Security Headers</h2>
+    <p>
+        Every document response from The DevTools Times includes hardened HTTP headers and document metadata to protect your privacy:
+    </p>
+    <ul>
+        <li><code>Content-Security-Policy</code>: Restricts script, style, font, image, and connection origins and blocks unauthorized framing (<code>frame-ancestors 'none'</code>).</li>
+        <li><code>Permissions-Policy</code>: Explicitly disables browser tracking and sensor APIs including <code>browsing-topics=()</code>, <code>interest-cohort=()</code>, <code>attribution-reporting=()</code>, <code>run-ad-auction=()</code>, <code>join-ad-interest-group=()</code>, <code>geolocation=()</code>, <code>camera=()</code>, and <code>microphone=()</code>.</li>
+        <li><code>Referrer-Policy</code>: Set to <code>no-referrer</code> on authentication routes and <code>strict-origin-when-cross-origin</code> across the site.</li>
+        <li><code>X-DNS-Prefetch-Control: off</code>: Prevents speculative DNS prefetching of external links.</li>
+        <li><code>Tk: N</code> &amp; <code>X-Privacy-Signal-Respected</code>: Confirms non-tracking status and honors <code>Sec-GPC</code> / <code>DNT</code> headers.</li>
+    </ul>
+
+    <h2>6. Your Privacy Controls</h2>
+    <p>
+        You can review, grant, or withdraw your consent for optional scripts at any time using the button below or the <em>Manage Privacy Preferences</em> link in the site footer.
+    </p>
+    <p>
+        <button
+            type="button"
+            data-skip-tracking="true"
+            onclick="window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('open-privacy-preferences'))"
+            class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white bg-gray-900 rounded hover:bg-gray-800 cursor-pointer"
+        >
+            Manage Privacy Preferences
+        </button>
+    </p>
 </LegalLayout>
